<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Amundsen returns four weeks after starting capsaicin cream. It stung for the first week and he has used it about three times a day. The burning is a little less, but the cold attacks still come most days in the late winter weather, and his average pain over the past week is 5 of 10. He still wakes some nights. He is willing now to try a tablet if it will not make him drowsy, because he drives and expects to fly again. He drinks rarely and takes no other medicines. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Finger pain</td><td>Average 5 of 10 over the past week</td></tr><tr><td>Capsaicin cream</td><td>About three times a day; stinging in the first week</td></tr><tr><td>Sleep</td><td>Still woken some nights</td></tr><tr><td>Preference</td><td>Will try a tablet that does not cause drowsiness</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

